							//- p.salesPage__text Discover our collection of ready-made Barong and Filipiniana—crafted with tradition and designed for modern style. Perfect for weddings, formal events, and special occasions.
							//- p.salesPage__text Walk in, try on, and take home. No waiting, no hassle. Just style.
							
							p.salesPage__text Shop ready-made Barong Tagalog, Filipiniana, bags, and accessories from Ang Hiyas, a Filipino clothing store in Australia offering elegant styles for weddings, cultural celebrations, and formal occasions.

							p.salesPage__text Explore pieces selected for quality fabrics, traditional embroidery, authentic Filipino craftsmanship, and modern elegance. Available from Logan near Brisbane, serving customers across Queensland and Australia.
							
